  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 (breaking)\n          - Redesigned callback model: GuardCallback/GuardOutcome\n          - Naming standardized: GreaterThanOrEqualException\n          - Exceptions enriched with CallerArgumentExpression (expressions in Message/Data)\n          - NullOrEmpty semantics clarified (plain non-null reference types are not empty)",
